<section class="grid-hero" aria-labelledby="grid-title">
  <div class="grid-frame grid-hero-frame">
    <div class="grid-intro">
      <h1 id="grid-title">공공의 공간을<br /><span>더 나은 일터로.</span></h1>
      <div class="grid-business">
        <p class="grid-business-title">공공기관·기업<br /> 사무가구 제안 및 납품</p>
        <p>예산·규격에 맞는 가구 선정부터<br /> 배치 제안, 납품·설치까지.</p>
        <a href="/contact/">프로젝트 상담하기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="grid-photo">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366811353-6870744d04b2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2200&q=88"
        alt="회의용 테이블과 의자 배치가 보이는 업무공간 참고 사진"
        width="2200"
        height="1467"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <figcaption>
        <span>가구 선정 · 배치 제안 · 납품·설치</span>
        <span class="grid-photo-note">업무공간 참고 이미지</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid-hero {
    background: var(--grid-paper);
    color: var(--grid-ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid-line);
  }

  .grid-hero-frame { position: relative; }

  .grid-hero-frame::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--grid-division);
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--grid-line);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .grid-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--grid-division) 1fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid-line);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 16px var(--grid-inset) 32px;
    font-size: clamp(52px, 6.5vw, 104px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.16;
    letter-spacing: -.065em;
  }

  h1 span {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 13px;
  }

  .grid-business {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
  }

  .grid-business p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .grid-business .grid-business-title { font-size: 15px; }

  .grid-business a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--grid-line);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .grid-business a span { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; }
  .grid-photo { margin: 0; }

  .grid-photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(520px, 68svh, 900px);
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 55%;
    filter: grayscale(1);
  }

  figcaption {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--grid-division) 1fr;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--grid-line);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  figcaption > span { padding: 18px var(--grid-inset); }
  figcaption .grid-photo-note { padding-left: 28px; font-size: 12px; }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .grid-business { padding: 20px 16px; gap: 12px; }
    .grid-business p, .grid-business a { font-size: 12px; }
    .grid-business .grid-business-title { font-size: 13px; }
    .grid-business br { display: none; }
    figcaption .grid-photo-note { padding-left: 16px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    h1 { padding: 22px var(--grid-inset) 30px; font-size: clamp(38px, 8vw, 56px); }
    h1 span { text-underline-offset: 8px; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }
    .grid-intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .grid-business { padding: 20px var(--grid-inset); border-top: 1px solid var(--grid-line); gap: 12px; }
    .grid-business .grid-business-title { font-size: 14px; }
    .grid-business a { width: calc(var(--grid-division) - 16px); margin-top: 4px; }
    .grid-photo img { height: 62svh; min-height: 340px; }
    .grid-hero-frame::after { top: auto; height: calc(max(62svh, 340px) + 51px); }
    figcaption { font-size: 10px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; min-height: 51px; }
    figcaption > span { padding: 8px var(--grid-inset) 0; }
    figcaption .grid-photo-note { padding: 0 var(--grid-inset) 8px; font-size: 10px; }
  }
</style>

<style is:global>
  .home-grid {
    --grid-paper: #c6cbdc;
    --grid-ink: #101113;
    --grid-line: #24262b;
    --grid-gutter: clamp(12px, 1.4vw, 28px);
    --grid-inset: 12px;
    --grid-division: 75%;
  }

  .home-grid .grid-frame {
    margin-inline: var(--grid-gutter);
    border-inline: 1px solid var(--grid-line);
  }

  .home-grid .grid-header a:focus-visible,
  .home-grid .grid-hero a:focus-visible,
  .home-grid summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid currentColor; outline-offset: -5px; }

  .home-grid .contact-grid > *,
  .home-grid .form > * { min-width: 0; }
</style>
